     </HEAD>
     <LINES>
      <TLINE>
       <TDFORMAT>U1</TDFORMAT>
       <TDLINE>SQL Cockpit - Rapid Report Generator Wizard</TDLINE>
      </TLINE>
      <TLINE>
       <TDFORMAT>*</TDFORMAT>
       <TDLINE>Use this wizard to generate an ABAP Class and a Result Structure from</TDLINE>
      </TLINE>
      <TLINE>
       <TDLINE>the current SELECT statement for quick use inside your Rapid Report</TDLINE>
      </TLINE>
      <TLINE>
       <TDLINE>Generator.</TDLINE>
      </TLINE>
      <TLINE>
       <TDFORMAT>*</TDFORMAT>
       <TDLINE>Move between the steps with &lt;ZH&gt;Back&lt;/&gt; and &lt;ZH&gt;Continue&lt;/&gt; down below</TDLINE>
      </TLINE>
      <TLINE>
       <TDLINE>or via the step links to the left.</TDLINE>
      </TLINE>
      <TLINE>
       <TDFORMAT>*</TDFORMAT>
       <TDLINE>On the last step you get a summary and you can start the generation with</TDLINE>
      </TLINE>
      <TLINE>
       <TDLINE>the &lt;ZH&gt;Generate Objects&lt;/&gt; button.</TDLINE>
      </TLINE>
     </LINES>
